## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

Do NOT:
- Skip session plan review
- Skip writing the E2E test first
- Implement without a failing test first
- Use a single struct for both the GORM model and the API response
- Put business logic in handlers
- Access the repository directly from a handler (must go through the service)
- Skip error wrapping (`fmt.Errorf("...: %w", err)`)
- Move to the next session with failing tests
- Implement more than one endpoint per session
- Skip session summary documentation
- Automatically start the next session
